      "writtenOn": "2021-01-23T03:25:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just a quick check for posterity:\n\nThe STM32H743 pull-up and pull-down are between 30 to 50 kOhms (https://screenshot.googleplex.com/4FHydn42wwjysdV.png). The icetower pulldown strap is 10kOhms.\n\nThe input pin would see 0.83V for low -- and 3.3V on high",
